AIR202 [*] `multiple_outputs` should be explicitly specified on `@task` returning a `Mapping`
  --> AIR202.py:16:1
   |
15 | # Dict literal return, no annotation -> infers False
16 | @task
   | ^^^^^
17 | def no_annotation_dict():
18 |     return {"x": 1}
   |
help: Add `multiple_outputs=False`
13 | # === Positive cases ===
14 |
15 | # Dict literal return, no annotation -> infers False
   - @task
16 + @task(multiple_outputs=False)
17 | def no_annotation_dict():
18 |     return {"x": 1}
19 |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

